  "body": "Architectural Luxury. Elevated Outlooks. Effortless Living.\r\n\r\nAn extraordinary expression of architectural excellence, elevated living and uncompromising luxury, this Brent Hulena-designed residence delivers the sophistication of a world-class apartment with the independence, privacy and freedom of freehold ownership. Commanding beautiful harbour, Bean Rock and Rangitoto views, the substantial five-bedroom home unfolds across three impeccably appointed levels, seamlessly connected by a private elevator. Crafted by Principle Homes with exceptional attention to detail, this is a residence where bespoke artistry, state-of-the-art technology and exquisite materials converge to create an exceptional lifestyle. For discerning downsizers, busy professionals and families seeking the ultimate luxury lock-up-and-leave, this is elevated living in every sense.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n\r\n* Exceptional Brent Hulena architectural design, expertly constructed by Principle Homes, showcasing impeccable craftsmanship and a sophisticated European-inspired aesthetic. Exquisite finishes include oak flooring, architectural concrete feature walls, luxurious Hermes wallpapers and carefully curated materials throughout.\r\n\r\n* Substantial 332 sqm (approx.) floorplan arranged across three expansive levels, comprising five generous bedrooms, three beautifully appointed bathrooms and multiple living environments. An exceptional combination of space and versatility for families, professionals and discerning downsizers.\r\n\r\n* Beautifully elevated position capturing harbour, Bean Rock and Rangitoto views, with the upper two levels enjoying a wonderful sense of openness, natural light and connection to the surrounding coastal landscape.\r\n\r\n* Private elevator servicing all three levels, providing effortless movement throughout the home and transforming this substantial residence into an exceptional alternative to luxury apartment living. Enjoy the space and independence of a standalone home without the everyday demands of stairs.\r\n\r\n* Freehold ownership delivers the freedom and independence that discerning buyers desire, without the body corporate fees and unit-title ownership associated with conventional apartment living. An outstanding proposition for those seeking a premium, low-maintenance lock-up-and-leave lifestyle.\r\n\r\n* Spectacular central-level living and entertaining maximises natural light and the elevated outlook, with expansive glazing and frameless glass balustrades framing views towards Rangitoto. A gas fireplace and central heating provide year-round comfort, while an additional ground-floor media room offers a superb environment for entertaining or relaxation.\r\n\r\n* Exceptional designer kitchen and adjoining scullery form a striking centrepiece for everyday living and entertaining, featuring premium Miele appliances, exquisite Skyfall granite, bespoke cabinetry and integrated storage. Beautifully appointed European-inspired bathrooms continue the commitment to luxury with Viscount White granite and premium fixtures and fittings.\r\n\r\n* Exclusive driveway access provides a wonderful sense of privacy and arrival, complemented by substantial three-car internal-access garaging and additional off-street parking. The carpeted garage also offers flexibility for gym equipment and storage, a rare and highly desirable advantage over conventional luxury apartments.\r\n\r\n* Seamless indoor-outdoor living extends to a covered entertaining patio and beautifully landscaped, easy-care grounds, providing the enjoyment of private outdoor space without the extensive maintenance of a traditional family estate. An exceptional turnkey proposition for those seeking more freedom and less responsibility.\r\n\r\n* Superb Orakei location within easy reach of the waterfront, Orakei Basin, beaches, coastal walkways and cycleways. Eastridge Shopping Centre and the vibrant Coates Avenue village offer an excellent selection of cafes, eateries and everyday conveniences, while the CBD, Orakei School and leading private schools in neighbouring Remuera are all readily accessible.\r\n\r\nThe opportunity is as compelling as the residence itself. With their next chapter already secured and settled, our vendors are committed to their sale and ready to meet the market on auction day. For discerning buyers seeking architectural distinction, effortless luxury and the freedom of freehold ownership, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nMethod of Sale: Set Date of Sale\r\nTime: Closing 2pm, 27th October 2026 (unless sold prior)\r\nOpen Home: Thursday | 6:00pm - 6:30pm | Saturday & Sunday | 12:00pm - 12:30pm | or by appointment\r\n\r\n//  A N D R E W  F A V A",
